#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:10
msgid "Hugging Face CLI (`hf`) Reference Guide"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:12
msgid ""
"The `hf` command is the modern command-line interface for interacting "
"with the Hugging Face Hub, providing tools to manage repositories, "
"models, datasets, and Spaces."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:14
msgid ""
"**IMPORTANT:** The `hf` command replaces the now deprecated `huggingface-"
"cli` command."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:16
msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:17
msgid "**Installation:** `curl -LsSf https://hf.co/cli/install.sh | bash -s`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:18
msgid ""
"**Help:** Use `hf --help` to view all available functions and real-world "
"examples."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:19
msgid ""
"**Authentication:** Recommended via `HF_TOKEN` environment variable or "
"the `--token` flag."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:23
msgid "Core Commands"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:25
msgid "General Operations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:26
msgid "`hf download REPO_ID`: Download files from the Hub."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:27
msgid "`hf upload REPO_ID`: Upload files/folders (recommended for single-commit)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:28
msgid ""
"`hf upload-large-folder REPO_ID LOCAL_PATH`: Recommended for resumable "
"uploads of large directories."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:29
msgid "`hf sync`: Sync files between a local directory and a bucket."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:30
msgid "`hf env` / `hf version`: View environment and version details."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:32
msgid "Authentication (`hf auth`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:33
msgid ""
"`login` / `logout`: Manage sessions using tokens from "
"[huggingface.co/settings/tokens](https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:34
msgid ""
"`list` / `switch`: Manage and toggle between multiple stored access "
"tokens."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:35
msgid "`whoami`: Identify the currently logged-in account."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:37
msgid "Repository Management (`hf repos`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:38
msgid "`create` / `delete`: Create or permanently remove repositories."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:39
msgid "`duplicate`: Clone a model, dataset, or Space to a new ID."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:40
msgid "`move`: Transfer a repository between namespaces."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:41
msgid "`branch` / `tag`: Manage Git-like references."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:42
msgid "`delete-files`: Remove specific files using patterns."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:46
msgid "Specialized Hub Interactions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:48
msgid "Datasets & Models"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:49
msgid ""
"**Datasets:** `hf datasets list`, `info`, and `parquet` (list parquet "
"URLs)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:50
msgid ""
"**SQL Queries:** `hf datasets sql SQL` — Execute raw SQL via DuckDB "
"against dataset parquet URLs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:51
msgid "**Models:** `hf models list` and `info`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:52
msgid "**Papers:** `hf papers list` — View daily papers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:54
msgid "Discussions & Pull Requests (`hf discussions`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:55
msgid ""
"Manage the lifecycle of Hub contributions: `list`, `create`, `info`, "
"`comment`, `close`, `reopen`, and `rename`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:56
msgid "`diff`: View changes in a PR."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:57
msgid "`merge`: Finalize pull requests."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:59
msgid "Infrastructure & Compute"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:60
msgid ""
"**Endpoints:** Deploy and manage Inference Endpoints (`deploy`, `pause`, "
"`resume`, `scale-to-zero`, `catalog`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:61
msgid ""
"**Jobs:** Run compute tasks on HF infrastructure. Includes `hf jobs uv` "
"for running Python scripts with inline dependencies and `stats` for "
"resource monitoring."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:62
msgid ""
"**Spaces:** Manage interactive apps. Includes `dev-mode` and `hot-reload`"
" for Python files without full restarts."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:64
msgid "Storage & Automation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:65
msgid ""
"**Buckets:** Full S3-like bucket management (`create`, `cp`, `mv`, `rm`, "
"`sync`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:66
msgid ""
"**Cache:** Manage local storage with `list`, `prune` (remove detached "
"revisions), and `verify` (checksum checks)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:67
msgid ""
"**Webhooks:** Automate workflows by managing Hub webhooks (`create`, "
"`watch`, `enable`/`disable`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:68
msgid ""
"**Collections:** Organize Hub items into collections (`add-item`, "
"`update`, `list`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:72
msgid "Advanced Usage & Tips"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:74
msgid "Global Flags"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:75
msgid "`--format json`: Produces machine-readable output for automation."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:76
msgid "`-q` / `--quiet`: Limits output to IDs only."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:78
msgid "Extensions & Skills"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:79
msgid ""
"**Extensions:** Extend CLI functionality via GitHub repositories using "
"`hf extensions install REPO_ID`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/huggingface-hub_SKILL.md:80
msgid "**Skills:** Manage AI assistant skills with `hf skills add`."
msgstr ""

